  "details": "Observed in version:\n1007\nDescription of bug:\nIf you navigate to a world's detail page via the author's profile page, then the back button on the world's detail page won't work properly.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KDGjybnMrT4\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Open the main Worlds browsing screen.\n2. Click the button to the right of the words \"You Are In\".\n3. On the World detail page, click on the button showing the author's name.\n4. On the Author profile page, click one of the author's other worlds.\n5. On the World detail page, click the Back button.\nExpected behaviour: It goes back to the Author profile page.\nObserved behaviour: It does nothing. Then, if you click the Back button again, it takes you back to before you opened the first World detail page for your current instance (i.e. back to the main Worlds browsing screen).",
